# Wise Repository Instructions

Wise contains three separate Visual Studio solutions.

All three solutions may contribute to the same customer-facing product.

Customer help documentation is stored in /docs as Markdown.

When working with documentation:

- Preserve existing terminology.
- Do not invent application functionality.
- Treat source code as evidence of current behavior.
- Treat existing documentation as the authority for customer-facing terminology.
- When source code and documentation disagree, flag the discrepancy.